  "np-01": "no input before arming; the rider never started riding, so the plugin was never armed (no hook installed). Counted as a failed attempt.",
  "np-02": "one pre-arm forward hold, then cycle forward,forward,jump 700,forward,steer_left 700,forward,jump 400,steer_right 700,forward (late phase after 150 s: steer 1200 ms). The input helper took 11-16 s per action, so 16 actions in 240 s. Rider descended about 950 m of altitude in the first ~95 s, then stood nearly still (speed < 2 m/s) until ~225 s.",
  "np-03": "one pre-arm forward hold, then cycle forward,forward,steer_left 1500,forward,jump 700,forward,steer_right 1500,forward,jump 400 (no late phase change). 22 actions in 240 s; rider kept moving most of the window (polled speed 1-47 m/s), descending about 1190 m."
